          "status": "open",
          "comments": "DEMO ONLY — fictional review by Demo Reviewer A. No check commands were executed.\nReference: V-230225 / SV-230225r1069297_rule. Unicode sample: café, résumé, Ω.\nDEMO ONLY — intentional missing Finding Details for the assessment-gap filter.",
          "finding_details": "",
