          "status": "not_a_finding",
          "comments": "DEMO ONLY — fictional review by Demo Reviewer A. No check commands were executed.\nReference: V-230255 / SV-230255r1017075_rule. Unicode sample: café, résumé, Ω.",
          "finding_details": "DEMO ONLY — simulated passing check.\nFictional evidence was recorded for demonstration; no real system was inspected.",
